 {"id":"d3-fig-flat","type":"figure","src":"/images/sei/flat-section.svg","alt":"A position-time graph in three parts: a rising line labeled walking away, a flat section in the middle marked with a question, and a falling line labeled coming back. The slope is the velocity.","caption":"Ride the slope: what is the object doing in part ②? · ¿Qué hace el objeto en la parte ②?","align":"full"},
 {"id":"d3-slope","type":"question","capture":true,"gate":true,"targetId":"u1.capture-pt-graph","xp":5,"question":{"prompt":"On a POSITION-time graph, the line goes flat for a while (part ②). What is the object doing?","options":[{"id":"const","icon":"➡","text":"Moving at a constant speed","text_l1":{"es":"Moviéndose a rapidez constante"},"feedback":"That is the classic mix-up. Flat means the POSITION is not changing — the slope is zero, so the velocity is zero. Flat = stopped. · Plano significa que la POSICIÓN no cambia: pendiente cero, velocidad cero. Plano = detenido."},{"id":"stopped","icon":"🛑","text":"Stopped — its position is not changing","text_l1":{"es":"Detenido — su posición no cambia"},"feedback":"Right. Zero slope = zero velocity. The graph claims the object stayed put. · Correcto: pendiente cero = velocidad cero."},{"id":"back","icon":"↩","text":"Moving back toward the start","text_l1":{"es":"Regresando hacia el inicio"},"feedback":"Moving back would be a line sloping DOWN (part ③). Flat is neither up nor down. · Regresar sería una línea que baja (parte ③). Plano no sube ni baja."}],"correctOptionId":"stopped","explain":"Say why in one sentence, using the word slope. · Di por qué en una oración, usando la palabra pendiente."},"sei":{"prompt_l1":{"es":"En una gráfica de POSICIÓN contra tiempo, la línea se pone plana un rato (parte ②). ¿Qué está haciendo el objeto?"},"frames":[{"level":1,"text":"Flat means the slope is [zero / constant], so the object is [stopped / moving].","text_l1":{"es":"Plano significa que la pendiente es [cero / constante], así que el objeto está [detenido / en movimiento]."}},{"level":2,"text":"The slope is ___, so the velocity is ___. The object is ___.","text_l1":{"es":"La pendiente es ___, así que la velocidad es ___. El objeto está ___."}}],"talkFirst":true,"modes":["choice"],"tier2Terms":["slope","constant"]},"note":"Slide 7 · Slope Explorer. Park the tangent on the flat section live to break the 'flat means constant speed' misconception. Gate: must land before the investigation."}
