 {"id":"d3-claim","type":"callout","variant":"tip","title":"A graph is a claim · Una gráfica es una afirmación","markdown":"Every position-time graph claims: **“the object moved like THIS.”** A claim can be tested. What motion would make this graph **wrong**? If you can name the motion that would falsify it, you understand the graph. · Toda gráfica de posición-tiempo afirma: «el objeto se movió ASÍ». Una afirmación se puede poner a prueba. ¿Qué movimiento haría que esta gráfica fuera **falsa**?\n\n**Your turn · Tu turno:** pick one graph from the investigation. 01 Tell its story — start, direction, speed. 02 Name ONE motion that would prove this graph false. · Elige una gráfica. 01 Cuenta su historia — inicio, dirección, rapidez. 02 Nombra UN movimiento que la haría falsa."},
 {"id":"d3-exit","type":"exit_ticket","capture":true,"targetId":"u1.capture-pt-graph","xp":5,"visibilityTrack":"cpa","talkFirst":true,"prompt":"EXIT TICKET · Pick one position-time graph from today. This graph claims the object ___. It would be WRONG if ___.","frame":"This position-time graph claims the object ___. It would be WRONG if ___.","sei":{"prompt_l1":{"es":"BOLETO DE SALIDA · Elige una gráfica de posición-tiempo de hoy. Esta gráfica afirma que el objeto ___. Sería FALSA si ___."},"visual":{"src":"/images/sei/flat-section.svg","alt":"A position-time graph with a rising, a flat and a falling section."},"frames":[{"level":1,"text":"This graph claims the object [moved away / stopped / came back]. It would be wrong if the object [moved away / stopped / came back].","text_l1":{"es":"Esta gráfica afirma que el objeto [se alejó / se detuvo / regresó]. Sería falsa si el objeto [se alejó / se detuvo / regresó]."}},{"level":2,"text":"This graph claims the object ___ because the slope is ___. It would be wrong if ___.","text_l1":{"es":"Esta gráfica afirma que el objeto ___ porque la pendiente es ___. Sería falsa si ___."}},{"level":3,"text":"Claim: ___ · Would be wrong if: ___","text_l1":{"es":"Afirmación: ___ · Sería falsa si: ___"}}],"wordBank":["moved away · se alejó","came back · regresó","stopped · se detuvo","steady · constante","faster · más rápido","slope · pendiente"],"talkFirst":true,"modes":["text","sketch"],"tier2Terms":["claim"]},"note":"Slide 10 · Exit Ticket (CPA frame). Honors students get h3 (JUSTIFY) in the same spot. Open response — write or sketch."}
 ]$$::jsonb
