 {"id":"d1c-nw","type":"observation","capture":true,"lobbyReady":true,"targetId":"u1.anchor-know-unknow","xp":5,"patternPrompt":"NOTICE × 3 — three facts you can point to in the briefing.","interpretPrompt":"WONDER — your best two questions, plus the one you starred on another group's chart.","patternFrame":"I notice that ___.","comparatives":["I notice that ___","I wonder whether ___","I wonder how ___","distance","velocity","mass","uncertainty"],"sei":{"prompt_l1":{"es":"OBSERVO × 3 — tres hechos del informe. ME PREGUNTO — tus dos mejores preguntas, más la que marcaste con estrella."},"frames":[{"level":1,"text":"I notice that [the distance / the velocity / the mass] is ___. I wonder whether ___.","text_l1":{"es":"Observo que [la distancia / la velocidad / la masa] es ___. Me pregunto si ___."}},{"level":2,"text":"I notice that ___. I wonder whether ___, because ___.","text_l1":{"es":"Observo que ___. Me pregunto si ___, porque ___."}}],"talkFirst":true,"modes":["text","sketch"]},"note":"10–25 min. SAVE the chart paper; you will point back to it in May. Misconceptions to note, not correct: is it visible already? do we know exactly what it is?"},
