 {"id":"d1c-year","type":"prose","markdown":"## The year is the puzzle\n\nEach shape of question becomes a unit: **U1** Motion & Forces · **U2** Gravitation & Fields · **U3** Momentum & Collisions · **U4** Energy & Work · **U5** Thermal Physics · **U6** Waves, Sound & Light · **U7** Electricity & Magnetism · **U8** The Car Project.\n\n### Unit 1's puzzle piece\n\n**How fast — and where — will it arrive?** To answer it, we need the language of motion: **position, velocity, acceleration**. We start building it tomorrow. *22 days to the first projection.*"}
